Package: washhealth
Title: Estimate Health Outcomes from Verified Water and Sanitation Outputs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", email = "lars@lse.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Turns verified water, sanitation and hygiene outputs of enterprises
    (connections, filters, toilets, hygiene products) into estimated health
    outcomes (diarrhoea cases, deaths and DALYs averted, people reached) for
    outcome-based finance. Every number comes from a versioned factor table with
    a citation; the package never invents a factor. Each result carries the
    ledger of factor rows used, a low, central and high value and a confidence
    label. Supports ex-ante scenarios (planned outputs and an incentive share)
    and ex-post estimates from verified outputs, a Quarto transaction report, a
    small Shiny app and flat factor exports for Airtable, mWater or Excel. The
    code is MIT licensed; the factor tables carried in the package are CC BY 4.0.
